# mcp-ingest schedule (T-082). Install with `crontab -e`, after replacing /path/to/MCP.
# Proposal of the architecture (SA): incremental every hour, full reconcile at 03:00.
# THRESHOLD TBD (Open question 5, PO confirmation pending): the cadence — the hourly/03:00 values are the
# defaults used until the freshness bound (NFR-004) is decided.
#
# The full run at 03:00 replaces that hour's incremental one (a full run is a superset), so the two
# never overlap. If a run overruns into the next slot, mcp-ingest exits 3 (source lock held) instead
# of running twice.
#
# Environment comes from ~/.config/mcp-ingest/env (see run-ingest.sh); do not put DSNs or tokens in
# this file. cron's PATH is minimal: make sure `uv` is reachable (absolute path below if needed).
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:$HOME/.local/bin

# m h dom mon dow  command
0 0-2,4-23 * * *  /path/to/MCP/infra/scheduler/run-ingest.sh incremental
0 3 * * *         /path/to/MCP/infra/scheduler/run-ingest.sh full
